  message: "Done in PR #1015 (dev 975a40653a). Behavioral evidence, not a proxy: a survey of ~/whole_bunch_of_repos/compose-go at tip emits the advisory on stderr naming inheritance-linker and type-hierarchy-linker -- the production path, one line, from the wire-up in cli.py next to emit_silence_summary. The self-survey correctly emits nothing (zero falsified here), so the detector was proven to return BOTH answers rather than only the quiet one. Predicate + reader + 17 tests; validate_pass_dependencies untouched and its 11 tests green. The audit this row existed to produce is recorded in the previous message and the repair is WI-rasal."  # 59f8
